<title>UK: MBNA prices and ups 30-year FRN to $280 million.</title>
<headline>MBNA prices and ups 30-year FRN to $280 million.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been priced and increased to $280 million from $250 million, lead manager Salomon Brothers International said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MBNA GLOBAL CAPITAL SECURITIES</p>
<p> AMT	  $280 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **01.FEB.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +80 BP    PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  BAA1/BBB- REOFFER    98.852    LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALL AFTER 10 YEARS. JUNIOR SUBORDINATED ISSUE.</p>
<p> NOTES	MBNA CORP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
